WEBVTT

00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:13,070
My collagen powder has methylated multivitamins.

00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:15,070
Should I discontinue?

00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:18,070
So I presume this is a collagen powder

00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:22,070
that you're using that you chose to purchase separately.

00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:25,070
That's not something I recommended.

00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:28,070
If it has methylated supplements in it,

00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:31,070
I would say to discontinue using it.

00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:34,070
And again, I have some blog posts on why cancer patients

00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:38,070
shouldn't be generally taking methylated supplements.

00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:41,070
And of course, the exception to that rule

00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:46,070
is if a person has elevated homocysteine,

00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:50,070
then we need to use folate

00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:56,070
and maybe methylcopolamine to help reduce homocysteine levels.

00:00:56,070 --> 00:00:59,070
But if you don't have elevated homocysteine

00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:01,070
and you have a diagnosis of cancer,

00:01:01,070 --> 00:01:04,070
you shouldn't be taking methylated vitamins.

00:01:04,070 --> 00:01:07,070
Even if your family members

00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:10,070
that don't have a diagnosis of cancer,

00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:13,070
can they take methylated multivitamins?

00:01:13,070 --> 00:01:17,070
Well yes and no, you just have to be careful

00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,070
as anybody has to be careful

00:01:20,070 --> 00:01:24,070
taking too much methylated supplements

00:01:24,070 --> 00:01:29,070
because they probably haven't had their genetic profile done.

00:01:29,070 --> 00:01:33,070
And if they have defects in different pathways,

00:01:33,070 --> 00:01:36,070
the excess methylated supplements

00:01:36,070 --> 00:01:39,070
can push different pathways

00:01:39,070 --> 00:01:42,070
and can cause other issues.

00:01:42,070 --> 00:01:45,070
So if a person doesn't have cancer,

00:01:45,070 --> 00:01:47,070
or if they do have cancer,

00:01:47,070 --> 00:01:49,070
and they have defects in their biopterate pathway,

00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:51,070
it can push that pathway,

00:01:51,070 --> 00:01:53,070
and cause some mood issues,

00:01:53,070 --> 00:01:55,070
some anger issues, rage issues,

00:01:55,070 --> 00:01:58,070
uncontrolled behavior.

00:01:58,070 --> 00:02:02,070
And you see this quite frequently.

00:02:02,070 --> 00:02:07,070
I would be careful taking excess methylated supplements from

00:02:07,070 --> 00:02:12,070
is when the supplement companies found out

00:02:12,070 --> 00:02:14,070
about the MTHFR defect,

00:02:14,070 --> 00:02:16,070
this is about 10, 15 years ago,

00:02:16,070 --> 00:02:20,070
all the companies started adding methyl tetrahydrofolate,

00:02:20,070 --> 00:02:25,070
methylcobolamine to many of their different supplements.

00:02:25,070 --> 00:02:28,070
So that if you're taking multiple supplements,

00:02:28,070 --> 00:02:31,070
you could be getting methylated folate,

00:02:31,070 --> 00:02:35,070
methylated cobalamine in multiple supplements.

00:02:35,070 --> 00:02:40,070
And many times it's far exceeding the recommended daily allowance.

00:02:40,070 --> 00:02:43,070
So you're getting way too much methylated supplements.

00:02:43,070 --> 00:02:45,070
But as a cancer patient,

00:02:45,070 --> 00:02:49,070
you have to be even more diligent to read your labels

00:02:49,070 --> 00:02:52,070
and to be careful on excess methylation

00:02:52,070 --> 00:02:55,070
because that turns off tumor suppressor genes.

00:02:55,070 --> 00:02:57,070
And one could even make an argument,

00:02:57,070 --> 00:03:00,070
maybe no one in the world is making this argument by me.

00:03:00,070 --> 00:03:05,070
But the high use of methylated supplements

00:03:05,070 --> 00:03:10,070
could actually be contributed to the increase cancer

00:03:10,070 --> 00:03:14,070
phenomena that we're seeing today.

00:03:14,070 --> 00:03:17,070
That's at least a piece, just one little piece.

00:03:17,070 --> 00:03:19,070
So even natural people,

00:03:19,070 --> 00:03:21,070
wow, how did I get cancer?

00:03:21,070 --> 00:03:24,070
I've been taking supplements and doing things naturally

00:03:24,070 --> 00:03:26,070
and eating organic for so long.

00:03:26,070 --> 00:03:28,070
And now I have this cancer.

00:03:28,070 --> 00:03:29,070
Look at your supplements.

00:03:29,070 --> 00:03:31,070
You've been taking methylated supplements.

00:03:31,070 --> 00:03:32,070
For the last 10 years,

00:03:32,070 --> 00:03:35,070
thinking that you're doing good for yourself

00:03:35,070 --> 00:03:39,070
and yet you are actually increasing your risk for cancer

00:03:39,070 --> 00:03:43,070
because you're turning off tumor suppressor genes.

00:03:43,070 --> 00:03:48,070
Just like if a person has a lot of tumor suppressor gene defects,

00:03:48,070 --> 00:03:53,070
you're basically silencing it by taking excess methyl groups.

00:03:53,070 --> 00:03:55,070
Just in my two cents.

